# Development only. Copy to frontend/.env.local (gitignored) and restart `npm run dev`.
# The login page's quick sign-in list on this machine, as "email|Name;email|Name". Keep real names and work emails
# here, never in the source code.
# VITE_TEST_ACCOUNTS replaces the built-in fictitious accounts (for the seed made from the team's real data; its
# tools/build_seed.py prints this line). Leave it empty to list the fictitious ones.
VITE_TEST_ACCOUNTS=
# Extra accounts listed first, such as your own work account.
VITE_EXTRA_TEST_ACCOUNTS=
